date-released: "2026-09-05"
abstract: "FedMPE coordinates mixed precision execution for federated 3D medical image segmentation. Its HMPE accelerates local training, a Budget Enabling Unit evaluates auxiliary operator deadlines, and a streaming aggregator handles precision tagged updates. This package contains code, frozen protocols, aggregate evidence, hardware profile values, and postprocessed results."
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - medical image segmentation
  - mixed precision training
  - FPGA acceleration
  - reconfigurable computing
  - execution scheduling
